[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3902.67, "timestamp": "01:05:02", "text": "完全不同。所以有时候我会这么做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3906.47, "timestamp": "01:05:06", "text": "嗯，就像排练一样，如果我在说话的话。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 3908.201, "timestamp": "01:05:08", "author": "@zergrush78319", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_nDwl-xtQg1-Z5v6Iv64Z42_Hei-15daYPmWXqoFR-4_b8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Even before messaging someone"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3909.19, "timestamp": "01:05:09", "text": "和某人在一起，但我注意到在此期间"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 3911.205, "timestamp": "01:05:11", "author": "@prathampro", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/7tcieem4yOUd9YXALarR3aYDlD62vnZzUlT_1QVJKtQgVzXDOl8byGd1-8hfYZmHnjbZGyS_5Uw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "parallel thinking"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3911.829, "timestamp": "01:05:11", "text": "那是一场跑步马拉松，我当时做了很多风险投资。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3914.309, "timestamp": "01:05:14", "text": "与初次见面的人见面"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3917.99, "timestamp": "01:05:17", "text": "对我来说，合作方面，嗯，我基本上……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3920.47, "timestamp": "01:05:20", "text": "没有进行太多排练。我就是这么想的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3922.87, "timestamp": "01:05:22", "text": "这是我新意识到的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3927.029, "timestamp": "01:05:27", "text": "嗯，之前就开始做了，而我当时用的都是这个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3928.789, "timestamp": "01:05:28", "text": "排练一下，比如“哦，我要说话了”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3931.589, "timestamp": "01:05:31", "text": "这个，还有这个，我会说说这个，看看情况。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3934.87, "timestamp": "01:05:34", "text": "他们的反应等等，然后"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3937.67, "timestamp": "01:05:37", "text": "呃，然后即兴发挥或者自由发挥或者"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3940.029, "timestamp": "01:05:40", "text": "某物。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3943.51, "timestamp": "01:05:43", "text": "啊，我明白了。所以你投入了很多"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3946.63, "timestamp": "01:05:46", "text": "考虑一下，就像你事先知道的那样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3950.15, "timestamp": "01:05:50", "text": "就像你知道的，嗯，你跟某人说话"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3952.39, "timestamp": "01:05:52", "text": "或者你遇到了某个人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3955.829, "timestamp": "01:05:55", "text": "是的。是的。即使是文字形式也一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3958.71, "timestamp": "01:05:58", "text": "因为你永远无法预料，对吧？"}]